        {
          "text": " Na viumbe hao walipokwenda, magurudumu yalikwenda kandokando yao, na viumbe hao walipoinuliwa, magurudumu nayo yaliinuliwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
